# Route: guide 16 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 38 to
# 42, 56 quests, 9.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale): Nesingwary's Expedition -> Lake Nazferiti ->
# Kurzen's Compound -> Rebel Camp -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Kal'ai Ruins
# -> The Vile Reef -> Ruins of Zul'Kunda -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Kal'ai
# Ruins -> Grom'gol Base Camp -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Kurzen's Compound
# -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); Cracking Maury's Foot
# (613; Mosh'Ogg Mauler 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Shaman 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Lord 45,
# Mosh'Ogg Warmonger 41-42, Mosh'Ogg Spellcrafter 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Butcher 44);
# Panther Mastery (193; Bhag'thera 40); Raptor Mastery (197; Tethis 43);
# Colonel Kurzen (202; Colonel Kurzen 39-40); Big Game Hunter (208; King
# Bangalash 43); Mai'Zoth (206; Mai'Zoth 47); Excelsior (628; Elder Saltwater
# Crocolisk 38).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2760 The
# Mithril Order; 2761 Smelt On, Smelt Off; 2762 The Great Silver Deceiver;
# 2763 The Art of the Imbue; 2764 Galvan's Finest Pupil; 2765 Expert
# Blacksmith!; 3645 Membership Card Renewal.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

